	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  postmaster.pid probleme]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=32590#p32590"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>dans les logs j&#039;avais repéré ca :</p><br /><p>&lt; 2021-06-14 20:44:25.782 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; startup process (PID 9520) was terminated by signal 6: Aborted<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:44:25.782 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; aborting startup due to startup process failure<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:47:26.308 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; database system was interrupted; last known up at 2021-06-14 16:39:40 CEST<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:47:26.399 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; invalid primary checkpoint record<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:47:26.399 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; record with zero length at 1022/3C3D2AE8<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:47:26.399 CEST &gt;LOG:&#160; invalid secondary checkpoint record<br />&lt; 2021-06-14 20:47:26.399 CEST &gt;PANIC:&#160; could not locate a valid checkpoint record</p>]]></content>
